[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      99[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### Why this is complete coverage of the valid domain
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     100[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     101[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The full input domain is `256^6 ≈ 2.8e14` pairs, which cannot be enumerated. But
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     102[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the C computation factors exactly as `f(Lum(A), Lum(B))` where
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     103[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `f(x, y) = max(x, y) / min(x, y)`:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     104[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     105[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * Z01 enumerates **every** one of the 2^24 colors, so every reachable `Lum`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     106[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   value — and therefore every `pow` argument, every branch-arm selection, and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     107[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   every narrowing cast — is compared bit-for-bit on both sides.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     108[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `f` itself is one `<` and one `divss`. C01 exhausts it over all 256×256
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     109[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   grayscale pairs, C04/C05 exhaust both branch directions, and C11–C13 exhaust
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     110[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   its three degenerate cases (`Low == 0` in either order, `0/0`).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     111[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     112[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Together these cover every distinct code path and every reachable intermediate
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     113[0m:[38;5;10m[49m value, not just a sample.
